 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 64.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，找到第一个把控制权交出去的位置，问一句：那一刻，哪些状态还没更新？",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，找到第一个把控制权交出去的位置，问一句：那一刻，哪些状态还没更新？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 11.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "审计的人，查一下编译器版本有没有已知的锁 bug，再查部署链上转原生币，会不会触发 fallback。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，查一下编译器版本有没有已知的锁 bug，再查部署链上转原生币，会不会触发 fallback。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.264,
   "dur": 7.944,
   "speechStart": 13.362,
   "speechEnd": 20.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "普通用户，存款前看协议有没有审计报告，范围是否覆盖你要用的合约。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，存款前看协议有没有审计报告，范围是否覆盖你要用的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-03.mp3",
   "start": 21.428,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 21.526,
   "speechEnd": 27.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "没有审计的新金库，只放能承受损失的金额。",
   "spoken": "没有审计的新金库，只放能承受损失的金额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-04.mp3",
   "start": 28.176,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 28.274,
   "speechEnd": 31.607
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。只调用一次取款，为什么能取走全部 10 个 ETH？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。只掉用一次取款，为什么能取走全部 10 个 ETH？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-05.mp3",
   "start": 32.668,
   "dur": 5.832,
   "speechStart": 32.766,
   "speechEnd": 37.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "因为银行先给钱、后记账。每一层嵌套调用，读到的都是同一个旧余额。",
   "spoken": "因为银航先给钱、后记账。每一层嵌套掉用，读到的都是同一个旧余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-06.mp3",
   "start": 39.0,
   "dur": 7.416,
   "speechStart": 39.098,
   "speechEnd": 45.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "这个答案的前提，是收款方能执行代码，而状态在交出控制权之前还没更新。",
   "spoken": "这个答案的前提，是收款方能执行代码，而状态在交出控制权之前还没更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-07.mp3",
   "start": 46.636,
   "dur": 7.128,
   "speechStart": 46.734,
   "speechEnd": 52.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "把顺序写对，第二层读到的就是 0。",
   "spoken": "把顺序写对，第二层读到的就是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5b-08.mp3",
   "start": 53.984,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 54.082,
